## Summary

Implements Pass 220 I081 on top of merged I079/I080.

- re-audits the 268 HOLD sources against all 405 pinned ComparatorChallenge configs;
- finds 25 strong structural title/comparator candidates;
- requires explicit source listing in `lean/docs/<family>.md`, pinned documentation/config identities, and nonempty theorem declarations before promotion;
- promotes 17 HOLD sources to source-bound formal-proof-backed theorem constructors;
- leaves 251 sources in HOLD;
- validates the active partition: 71 theorem sources + 251 HOLD sources = 322 novelty sources, with zero gap or duplicate assignment;
- preserves I079/I080 as immutable historical registries;
- provides callable promoted-constructor invocation, proof-declaration allowlists, deterministic candidate Hash72 receipts, and replay.

One promotion uses an explicitly documented stronger-result implication: the formal generalized-star-height bound of three is documented as implying the accompanying paper's bound of four.

No canonical truth promotion, execution authority, VM81 mutation, canonical Hash72/Hash216 minting, persistence, learning, model-weight mutation, or floating-point authority is granted.

